stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Normal
    Normal --> Derated: overtemperature warning
    Derated --> Normal: condition clears
    Normal --> Latched: critical / overcurrent / open LED
    Latched --> Off: clear faults
    Normal --> SafeMode: corrupted configuration
    SafeMode --> Off: clear faults
    Normal --> Off: heartbeat lost
    Off --> Normal: power on / heartbeat returns
    note right of Latched: power/start blocked
